# NOTE: E055 (IncludeHashMismatch) requires hash verification with --require-integrity flag
# and a file with known content/hash. The current corpus test infrastructure does not support
# passing --require-integrity flag or setting up temporary files with known hashes.
# This error is tested via unit tests in src/builtins.rs::include_with_wrong_blake3_hash_errors.
#
# To enable corpus testing, we would need either:
# 1. A directive like `# require_integrity` in split_test_file()
# 2. Pre-computed test files with known blake3 hashes in a fixtures directory
# 3. Extension of eval_source_with_config() to accept require_integrity parameter
#
# This file exists as documentation of the gap and will be updated when infrastructure supports it.
